{"unit_id":"HaoyanZhang123__dsh-plugin-control-your-schedule#feature-stickies","repo":"HaoyanZhang123/dsh-plugin-control-your-schedule","commit":"e24bd2262b81ea6c0b7c7d1dadfcd28655edb6d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Paper Isle 的「便签」功能：创建可拖动、自动保存的短便签，并可调整便签顺序和颜色。便签内容保存在工作区中，删除的便签进入回收区。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/paper-os.html:13631","assets/paper-os.html:18550"]}
{"unit_id":"HaoyanZhang123__dsh-plugin-control-your-schedule#feature-pages","repo":"HaoyanZhang123/dsh-plugin-control-your-schedule","commit":"e24bd2262b81ea6c0b7c7d1dadfcd28655edb6d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Paper Isle 的「纸页笔记」功能：创建长篇笔记页面，在侧栏搜索和切换页面，也可置顶常用页面。编辑内容会自动保存到当前工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/paper-os.html:19623","assets/paper-os.html:19826"]}
{"unit_id":"HaoyanZhang123__dsh-plugin-control-your-schedule#feature-calendar","repo":"HaoyanZhang123/dsh-plugin-control-your-schedule","commit":"e24bd2262b81ea6c0b7c7d1dadfcd28655edb6d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Paper Isle 的「日历与待办」功能：按日期添加任务，设置紧急程度并勾选完成；每日重复任务会按日期投影，完成后可停止重复。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/paper-os.html:20184","assets/paper-os.html:13890","assets/paper-os.html:13906"]}
{"unit_id":"HaoyanZhang123__dsh-plugin-control-your-schedule#feature-prompts","repo":"HaoyanZhang123/dsh-plugin-control-your-schedule","commit":"e24bd2262b81ea6c0b7c7d1dadfcd28655edb6d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Paper Isle 的「提示词库」功能：搜索、编辑、置顶和管理可复用提示词；聊天输入框旁的 Prompts 入口可将选中的内容插入草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/paper-os.html:19162","src/client.src.js:1137"]}
{"unit_id":"HaoyanZhang123__dsh-plugin-control-your-schedule#feature-drawing","repo":"HaoyanZhang123/dsh-plugin-control-your-schedule","commit":"e24bd2262b81ea6c0b7c7d1dadfcd28655edb6d7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Paper Isle 的「画纸」功能：在画布上自由绘制，使用橡皮、颜色、不同笔尖并撤销或重做；当前画纸可导出为 PNG 文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["assets/paper-os.html:21148","assets/paper-os.html:21206","assets/paper-os.html:21267"]}
